    "video": {
      "name": "Low Carb Cheeseburger In Bowl [Easy Keto Dinner]",
      "description": "This low-carb cheeseburger in a bowl recipe takes the flavors of a classic cheeseburger and makes it keto-friendly so you can enjoy the taste of cheeseburger guilt-free. Packed with protein and lots of other important vitamins and minerals, these bowls are sure to satisfy your lunch or dinner appetite!\n\nMaking these bowls is easy. Once you’ve prepped the ingredients, you cook the ground beef, garlic, tomatoes, zucchini, and everything else in a pan before melting cheese over the whole dish. Once cooked, the mixture can be served in bowls for the whole family to enjoy. To add some extra goodness, you can serve this recipe with a fresh green salad or some steamed greens.\n\nThis dish is perfect to whip up on a weeknight or for a special weekend treat. It will especially be loved by kids who will love the cheese and beef flavors. You can even freeze any leftovers so you’ve got a quick and easy lunch or dinner in the freezer to take out at short notice.\n\nDon’t just take our word for it. Go ahead and give this keto-friendly cheeseburger bowl recipe a try—it’s sure to become a new family favorite!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1/2 medium yellow onion\n2 teaspoon fresh garlic\n2 tablespoon avocado oil\n500 gram ground beef\n3 tablespoon unsweetened dill pickle relish\n200 gram canned tomatoes with green chiles\n2 tablespoon tomato paste\n1 tablespoon dijon mustard\n2 medium zucchini, diced\n1 cup shredded cheddar cheese\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 4 servings of Low Carb Cheeseburger In Bowl. Each serving comes out to be 543 calories, 42.7g fat, 7.5g net carbs, and 30.9g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
